;
; How Forage indexes one bounty in MYRA (forage_rules.h FR4): its number
; on the node's board (4 digits), its kind (1 a bounty to claim, 2 one this
; node posts), the swarm tokens a cycle its work takes and its draw in
; milliwatts (9 digits each), its value in minor units (15 digits, Sutra's
; witnessed fee range), the minutes it takes (9 digits) and its status (0
; waiting for the owner, 1 sent, 2 refused by zxvd, 3 cancelled). Forage
; asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXFORAGE(bounty:i4) = kind:i1! ^ tokens:i9! ^ mw:i9! ^ amount:i15! ^ minutes:i9! ^ status:i1!
